From: ouroboros420 <ouroboros420@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mangoapp: skip the focus query while hidden

gamescope sends mangoapp a message for every presented frame, and the
message thread called get_prop("GAMESCOPE_FOCUSED_APP_GFX") on each one,
a synchronous XGetWindowProperty round trip that also wakes Xwayland.
steam_focused is only needed while the HUD is drawn or the logger runs, so
when mangoapp is hidden, which is most of the time in game mode, that was
60-120 pointless X round trips a second. Only query it in those cases; the
first frame after unhiding still queries it before the frame is drawn.
---
diff --git a/src/app/main.cpp b/src/app/main.cpp
index 5af5b6e..43daa6b 100644
--- a/src/app/main.cpp
+++ b/src/app/main.cpp
@@ -215,10 +215,11 @@ static void msg_read_thread(){
                     // msgrcv counts the payload without the leading message type.
                     HUDElements.g_upscaler = msg_size >= offsetof(mangoapp_msg_v1, upscaler) + sizeof(mangoapp_v1->upscaler) - sizeof(long)
                         ? mangoapp_v1->upscaler : -1;
-                    if (!real_params->enabled[OVERLAY_PARAM_ENABLED_mangoapp_steam]){
-                        steam_focused = get_prop("GAMESCOPE_FOCUSED_APP_GFX") == 769;
-                    } else {
+                    // get_prop() is an X round trip; skip it while nothing draws or logs
+                    if (real_params->enabled[OVERLAY_PARAM_ENABLED_mangoapp_steam]){
                         steam_focused = false;
+                    } else if (!real_params->no_display || logger->is_active()) {
+                        steam_focused = get_prop("GAMESCOPE_FOCUSED_APP_GFX") == 769;
                     }
 
                     if (msg_size > offsetof(mangoapp_msg_v1, latency_ns))
